{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 63,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.70490264892578,
        27.289522171020508,
        327.8228759765625,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "7. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF DYSENTERY",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0729064941406,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "prior to the 1990s and involved antibiotics that are no longer used because of highly",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0427551269531,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "resistant Shigella (i.e., cotrimoxazole, ampicillin, nalidixic acid). The review focused",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.0528564453125,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "on outcome variables of limited interest: duration of diarrhoea and continuation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0729064941406,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "of dysentery. It also includes studies conducted in developing as well as developed",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.102783203125,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "countries, without taking into account the type of Shigella strains responsible for the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        315.3428039550781,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "dysentery, therefore limiting the generalizability of the findings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.1214294433594,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "The CHERG review only included studies published after 1990, evaluating",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.0729064941406,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "the efficacy of antibiotics presently recommended by WHO (i.e. ciprofloxacin,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.042724609375,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "ceftriaxone, pivmecillinam, and azithromycin) and to which resistance is so far not",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.05279541015625,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "a problem in children aged < 16 years, and conducted in middle- and low-income",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.05291748046875,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "countries. The review was, therefore, more generalizable to the paediatric population",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.0628662109375,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and low-resource settings. The review also focused on three outcome variables that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        190.9729461669922,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "have a direct impact on survival:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        234.41151428222656,
        399.10174560546875,
        247.90151977539062
      ],
      "text": "Clinical failure: Absence of marked improvement in, or worsening of, illness with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        236.63796997070312,
        63.541900634765625,
        245.63795471191406
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        247.41151428222656,
        396.8504943847656,
        260.9015197753906
      ],
      "text": "the presence of bloody mucoid stools, more than a trace of blood in stool, abdomi­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        260.4114990234375,
        197.61151123046875,
        273.9015197753906
      ],
      "text": "nal pain, tenesmus and/or fever;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        275.39569091796875,
        396.8504943847656,
        288.8857116699219
      ],
      "text": "Cacteriological failure: Failure to clear an enteropathogen isolated from an indi­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.6221618652344,
        63.541900634765625,
        286.6221618652344
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        288.39569091796875,
        362.3714904785156,
        301.8857116699219
      ],
      "text": "vidual on admission to the study, by the end of the treatment period; and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        303.3799743652344,
        396.8504943847656,
        316.8699951171875
      ],
      "text": "Bacteriological relapse: Reappearance of an enteropathogen in stool after the en­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        305.6064453125,
        63.541900634765625,
        314.6064453125
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        316.3798828125,
        226.6615753173828,
        329.8699035644531
      ],
      "text": "teropathogen was cleared by treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        335.0491943359375,
        399.0729064941406,
        348.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "The Cochrane systematic review identified two RCTs comparing antibiotics and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        348.0491943359375,
        399.14288330078125,
        361.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "placebo or no drug, and 14 RCTs comparing the effectiveness of different antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        361.0491943359375,
        399.0927429199219,
        374.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "regimens for treatment of Shigella dysentery [Christopher, 2010]. The trials included",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        374.0491943359375,
        399.0329284667969,
        387.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "a total of 1748 participants and were randomized based on clinical symptoms of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        387.0491943359375,
        399.0528564453125,
        400.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "dysentery, prior to bacteriological confirmation. The GRADE tables show low- to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        400.0491943359375,
        399.0928955078125,
        413.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "moderate quality evidence that antibiotic therapy significantly reduces the number",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        413.0491943359375,
        399.0928955078125,
        426.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "of children with dysentery on follow-up compared to no antibiotic [Kabir 1986;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        426.0491943359375,
        127.64289855957031,
        439.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "Rodriguez 1989].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        439.0491943359375,
        399.09149169921875,
        452.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "The review had two primary efficacy outcomes. The first primary outcome,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        452.0491943359375,
        399.0128173828125,
        465.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "diarrhoea on follow-up, was reported by all but three trials [Kabir 1986; Gotuzzo",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        465.0491943359375,
        399.09295654296875,
        478.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "1989; Islam 1994]; the duration of follow-up was five days in 10 out of 13 trials. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        478.0491943359375,
        399.0428466796875,
        491.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "second primary outcome, relapse, was reported by four trials [Haltalin 1973; Salam,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        491.0491943359375,
        399.1130065917969,
        504.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "2010; Shanks 1999; Leibovitz 2000); the duration of follow-up for this outcome",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        504.0491943359375,
        166.16293334960938,
        517.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "ranged from 10 to 20 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        517.0491943359375,
        399.031494140625,
        530.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "Limited data from one three-armed trial of people with moderately severe illness",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        530.0491943359375,
        399.0228576660156,
        543.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "suggest that antibiotics reduce the episodes of diarrhoea at follow-up (furazolidone",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        543.0491943359375,
        399.05291748046875,
        556.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "versus no drug RR 0.21, 95% CI 0.09 to 0.48, 73 participants; cotrimoxazole versus no",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        556.0491943359375,
        336.05291748046875,
        569.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "drug RR 0.30, 95% CI 0.15 to 0.59, 76 participants)[ Rodriguez 1989].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        569.0491943359375,
        399.0514221191406,
        582.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "The review did not find robust evidence to suggest that antibiotics of a particular",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        582.0491943359375,
        399.1028747558594,
        595.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "class were better than those belonging to a different class. However, there were limited",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        595.0491943359375,
        399.0429992675781,
        608.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "data from a subgroup of studies to suggest that fluoroquinolone (ciprofloxacin) was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        608.0491943359375,
        399.1429138183594,
        621.5391845703125
      ],
      "text": "more effective than beta-lactam (ampicillin) in reducing diarrhoea among adults and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4781036376953,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.56910705566406,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "49",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}